## Development

Requires the JDK named in `.java-version` (on macOS, `brew install openjdk@<major>`; the Makefile finds it) and make. Maven comes from the committed wrapper, `./mvnw`.

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make build` | Runnable jar at `target/{{project_slug}}.jar` |
| `make test` | Unit tests |
| `make test-integration` | Runs the packaged jar |
| `make fmt` | Format with Spotless |
| `make ci` | Everything CI runs |

See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) for how the code is laid out.

